1
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:27,599
You never forget your first kill.

2
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:49,199
Terrifier is a horror, thriller film directed by Damien Leone.

3
00:10:04,799 --> 00:10:10,799
A maniacal clown named Art terrorizes three young women on
Halloween night and everyone else who stands in his way.

4
00:13:26,399 --> 00:13:32,399
Art the Clown, played by David Howard Thornton.

5
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:54,000
Tara Heyes, played by Jenna Kanell.

6
00:20:09,599 --> 00:20:15,599
Victoria Heyes, played by Samantha Scaffidi.

7
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:37,200
Dawn, played by Catherine Corcoran.

8
00:26:52,799 --> 00:26:58,799
Cat Lady, played by Pooya Mohseni.

9
00:30:14,399 --> 00:30:20,399
Mike the Exterminator, played by Matt McAllister.

10
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:42,000
Terrifier is a 2016 American independent slasher film written,
edited, co-produced, and directed by Damien Leone.

11
00:36:57,599 --> 00:37:03,599
The film stars Jenna Kanell, Samantha Scaffidi,
Catherine Corcoran, and David Howard Thornton.

12
00:40:19,199 --> 00:40:25,199
The plot centers on partygoer Tara Heyes (Kanell) and her sister Victoria (Scaffidi), who become targets
of the enigmatic serial killer known only as Art the Clown (Thornton) on Halloween night.

13
00:43:40,799 --> 00:43:46,799
Leone had created the character of Art the Clown for his short film The 9th
Circle (2008) and then created another short with Terrifier (2011).

14
00:47:02,400 --> 00:47:08,400
These shorts would generate interest for what became the anthology film
All Hallows' Eve (2013), which contained both segments.

15
00:50:24,000 --> 00:50:30,000
With the film, Leone wrote it specifically as a means of showcasing
the character of Art and his practical effects work.

16
00:53:45,599 --> 00:53:51,599
Leone has since expressed regret for leaving the protagonists underdeveloped.

17
00:57:07,199 --> 00:57:13,199
Leone tried to raise funds for the Terrifier feature film with an
Indiegogo campaign, which fell short of its goal.

18
01:00:28,799 --> 01:00:34,799
However, producer Phil Falcone helped contribute funds to help
make the film in exchange for a producer credit.

19
01:03:50,400 --> 01:03:56,400
Mike Giannelli, who portrayed prior incarnations of Art, retired from acting before
production began, and David Howard Thornton replaced him as Art.

20
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:18,000
Terrifier premiered at the Telluride Horror Show on October 15, 2016, and received a limited
theatrical release in the United States on March 15, 2018, by Epic Pictures Releasing.

21
01:10:33,599 --> 01:10:39,599
The film received generally mixed reviews from critics, with praise directed towards the special effects and
the portrayals of Kanell, Scaffidi and Thornton, while the writing was subject to criticism.

22
01:13:55,199 --> 01:14:01,199
Despite that, the film became a cult film, and would eventually generate a media franchise, with
Terrifier 2, released on October 6, 2022 and Terrifier 3, released on October 11, 2024.

23
01:17:16,800 --> 01:17:22,800
The film explores themes of halloween, clown, gore, slasher, maniac.

24
01:20:38,399 --> 01:20:44,399
The tone is dark and intense.
